        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unko Technica is an unapologetic, high-difficulty 2D action game. Across a dazzling, neon-lit world, you must guide an automatically-moving &quot;Unko&quot; (Japanese for &quot;poop&quot;) to its ultimate goal: the toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the comical facade, this game demands flawless timing and razor-sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all fans of hardcore action: We deliver the ultimate test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.poster.avif?t=1765858787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.webm?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.mp4?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are no emotionally moving scenarios or charming characters here. Just pure, demanding gameplay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Poop to the Toilet Bowl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Depth </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in the game is &quot;Jump.&quot;That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just this single action, you'll navigate over 150 diverse and unforgiving stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true test of mettle awaits, where repeated failure and trial-and-error are the only paths to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Uniquely Challenging Stages </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, spike walls, ON/OFF switches...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique and devious gimmicks will appear as you advance, escalating the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming these different traps requires quick reflexes and genuine puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Pulse-Pounding Sound </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and an addictive, cool soundtrack intensify the gameplay, completing the stylish aesthetic of the Poop Precision Platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.poster.avif?t=1765858787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.webm?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.mp4?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Spin, and Customize Your Own Poop! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the UN-COINs you collect in stages to spin a Gacha for customization items for your Unko, or to unlock even more challenging bonus stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with tons of unique items to collect—prove your mastery by collecting them all!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unko Technica is an unapologetic, high-difficulty 2D action game. Across a dazzling, neon-lit world, you must guide an automatically-moving &quot;Unko&quot; (Japanese for &quot;poop&quot;) to its ultimate goal: the toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the comical facade, this game demands flawless timing and razor-sharp precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To all fans of hardcore action: We deliver the ultimate test of skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.poster.avif?t=1765858787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.webm?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/9432ab8905eb86eb43794310b302bafc.mp4?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are no emotionally moving scenarios or charming characters here. Just pure, demanding gameplay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the Poop to the Toilet Bowl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Brutal Depth </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only control in the game is &quot;Jump.&quot;That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just this single action, you'll navigate over 150 diverse and unforgiving stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true test of mettle awaits, where repeated failure and trial-and-error are the only paths to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied and Uniquely Challenging Stages </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bouncing bubbles, crumbling platforms, spike walls, ON/OFF switches...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of unique and devious gimmicks will appear as you advance, escalating the difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcoming these different traps requires quick reflexes and genuine puzzle-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Visuals and Pulse-Pounding Sound </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-futuristic, neon-colored graphics and an addictive, cool soundtrack intensify the gameplay, completing the stylish aesthetic of the Poop Precision Platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.poster.avif?t=1765858787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.webm?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101010/extras/a527b3bd9e885f1e37528c2cf5b82b20.mp4?t=1765858787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect, Spin, and Customize Your Own Poop! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the UN-COINs you collect in stages to spin a Gacha for customization items for your Unko, or to unlock even more challenging bonus stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is packed with tons of unique items to collect—prove your mastery by collecting them all!</p>",
